      "defect_type": "Type II",
      "severity": 2,
      "explanation": "The 340B survey, ASP-minus-33.4-percent proposal, and 3-percent offset are internally connected, but the available text does not fully show the bridge from survey inputs to the chosen rate and offset structure.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "section": "Section XXIII / 340B drug payment discussion",
          "quote_or_absence": "from January 1, 2026 through April 7, 2026, we conducted a survey of the acquisition costs for each separately payable drug acquired by all hospitals paid under the OPPS."
        },
        {
          "section": "Section XXIII / 340B drug payment discussion",
          "quote_or_absence": "Taking the survey results into account, we propose for CY 2027 to pay ASP minus 33.4 percent for 340B acquired drugs."
        },
        {
          "section": "Section XXIII / 340B remedy offset discussion",
          "quote_or_absence": "For CY 2027, we propose to increase the annual percent reduction ... from 0.5 percent to 3 percent."
